<title>POLAND: CHEMISKOR OCT NET RISES TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>CHEMISKOR OCT NET RISES TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.16 vs   0.04</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.25 vs   0.08</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.23 vs   0.10</p>
<p> Sales		    1.99 vs   1.54</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.54 vs   0.31</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.92 vs   0.50</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.74 vs   0.75</p>
<p> Sales		   11.56 vs  10.43</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish leather company is Chemiskor SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
